# Unicode CLDR 47, cldr-json cldr-dates-full/main/mt/ca-gregorian.json,
# months.format.wide and .abbreviated.  Maltese month names are Sicilian/
# Italian borrowings and take no definite article in a date.
# The CLDR abbreviation Mar is not shipped: mar is the ordinary perfect of
# mar, "to go", and reads as a verb far more often than as a month.
marzu
